Well, the obvious choice is a quiet ghost town,
which would be nice and romantic.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.640
A slum district that's crawling
with zombies is the way to go...

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:59.140
"Oh, no! I'm scared!" Wouldn't it be desirable
