00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.440
Satan's playing a dating sim...

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.270
I see! You sure are smart!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:10.610
It really bugs me how his right-hand man's
by his side giving him sincere advice.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.830
Mr. Satan... I see you like Japanese video games, huh?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.460
What's more, rather old-school dating sims at that...

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.710
Apparently, he also loves anime.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.540
He's actually a pretty good guy...

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.380
I like you so very much!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.010
I like your style, Nyanko. I think I'll buy this, after all.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.510
I'll make the arrangements.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.930
Hey, you over there! Send this to European Hell!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.810
I'll pay by credit card.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.640
You can't use credit cards here.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.020
What? They don't take credit cards?!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:45.770
Gah!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.360
Long time no see, Beelzebub.

