Nekomata Nyanko 2

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:55.320
What's this? There's a Nekomata Nyanko 2?

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.330
Wonderful~

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:02.540
Is it alright for Lord Satan of all people to be
