00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:06.500
Lay off! The will of Satan is the will of all devils!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:10.010
Huh? So, does that mean all devils are like this, then?

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.840
Shut up, already...

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.550
I can't even hear Nyanko voice her lines, okay?!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:17.890
Oh!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.100
Running into you at a place like this is...

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.390
just perfect.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.980
Take me on in a fighting game.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.520
FIGHTING
WILDLIFE CHARICATURES

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.070
Let's play this one.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.530
Another request out of nowhere...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.910
Yeah, I'm not very good at pulling off
the special moves in this one.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.410
The special moves are my forte!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.500
I'll find a way to put up a fight.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.040
Fight!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.920
Wai... His defense is devilishly good.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.720
This damn guy's making precise light attacks!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.100
That punk's character is starting
to look more and more like him!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.440
This is how it always goes with him!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.110
Ah!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.070
Excellent!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.120
I did it! A special move!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:25.080
My first special move! You see that?! I'm so happy!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:29.210
Don't test it out on me! It pisses me off
to see you genuinely rejoicing like that!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:29.130
FIGHTING
WILDLIFE CHARICATURES

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:34.260
When facing off against the lord of the devils,
doesn't it cross your mind to show a little respect?

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.840
Even if my opponent was a child,
I'd refuse to go easy on them when gaming.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:44.310
The reason why, you see, is that would amount
to looking down on them as though they're a halfwit.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.190
Similarly, I avoid mixing business and golf.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.560
I go all out when I play.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.280
How the hell was this guy able to advance
within a Japanese organization?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:59.120
Well then, you'll be heading
to Enma Palace now, correct?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.950
Let's go there together.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.080
Ah, is that what brings you to Japan, then?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.370
But first and foremost you hit the arcade, huh?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.250
You sure do like video games, huh?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.000
It's now time to provide him
with some corporate entertainment.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:17.130
I can't believe you'd utter the phrase "corporate
entertainment" in front of the guy you'll be hosting.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:23.100
Two days ago, Satan suddenly got in touch and said,
"I'll be coming to Japan, so be sure to entertain me."

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:28.270
Nothing wrong with that, right? I got an urge to eat
some Japanese food and enjoy some leisure time.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.860
You'll be able to enjoy some cuisine at Enma Palace.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.940
As for leisure, we're planning to play golf.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.650
In other words, you don't actually intend to entertain me...

