of being assailed by boulders.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.130
Wh-what's going on here?!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.470
Put a stop to this!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.800
Stop these dangerous boulders!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.310
Lilith, get behind me!

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.230
You're so stylish, dear!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.310
That so?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.270
Dear, look... up.

